01:09:22.428 --> 01:09:25.036
That's Goku's Kameameha!


01:09:33.696 --> 01:09:35.023
What?


01:09:43.768 --> 01:09:45.855
Here's my return.


01:09:49.862 --> 01:09:52.431
I'll block such a thing!


01:10:03.719 --> 01:10:05.259
What is that?


01:10:05.259 --> 01:10:07.047
It's Birus attack.


01:10:07.047 --> 01:10:08.907
This is bad!


01:10:13.281 --> 01:10:16.026
Crap!


01:10:18.883 --> 01:10:21.793
It seems that you haven't realised.


01:10:21.793 --> 01:10:23.511
Ab..About what?


01:10:23.511 --> 01:10:27.172
It's been a while since you lost your
Super Saiyan God powers.


01:10:27.172 --> 01:10:30.309
He's right.


01:10:32.128 --> 01:10:33.769
But...


01:10:33.769 --> 01:10:37.620
It seems that while you were fighting
as a god,


01:10:37.620 --> 01:10:41.982
you've absorbed that world into your body.


01:10:41.982 --> 01:10:47.092
That's why when you transformed back,
your powers didn't decrease drastically.


01:10:47.092 --> 01:10:48.869
You're really something.


01:10:48.869 --> 01:10:51.754
I would even call you a rare being,
a genius!


01:10:51.754 --> 01:10:54.626
That makes me happy, but...


01:10:54.626 --> 01:10:56.778
In that case, be happy.


01:10:56.778 --> 01:10:58.861
That's what you wanted, right?


01:10:58.861 --> 01:11:00.536
I can't do that.


01:11:00.536 --> 01:11:03.219
The biggest problem is...


01:11:03.219 --> 01:11:07.445
The fact that there is a huge
difference in power!


01:11:07.445 --> 01:11:10.576
Then, give up and surrender!


01:11:59.806 --> 01:12:01.768
What's happening?


01:12:18.210 --> 01:12:20.117
Crap!


01:12:30.336 --> 01:12:31.469
Goku!


01:12:31.469 --> 01:12:33.539
Goku!


01:13:16.340 --> 01:13:19.255
Oi, what did you do just now?


01:13:19.255 --> 01:13:22.972
I don't know.


01:13:22.972 --> 01:13:25.489
You don't know?


01:13:25.489 --> 01:13:27.304
You are certainly interesting.


01:13:43.345 --> 01:13:46.855
What's up, why did you stop?


01:13:46.855 --> 01:13:51.528
I wanted to say I lost to you.


01:13:51.528 --> 01:13:53.403
Lost...?


01:13:53.403 --> 01:13:55.577
I lost.


01:13:55.577 --> 01:13:57.490
Lord Birus you're really strong.


01:13:57.490 --> 01:14:00.155
I didn't stand a chance.


01:14:00.155 --> 01:14:02.341
You're certainly the universe's best!


01:14:02.341 --> 01:14:07.501
You've finally realised the terrifying power of,
Lord Birus; the God of Destruction.


01:14:07.501 --> 01:14:11.334
Nevertheless, you were certainly strong too.


01:14:11.334 --> 01:14:17.010
Up until now, you're the 2nd strongest
opponent I've faced in my long history of battles.


01:14:17.010 --> 01:14:20.784
What, I'm 2nd?


01:14:22.394 --> 01:14:26.696
Finally, I'll tell you something good.


01:14:26.696 --> 01:14:30.823
What, are you not going to
destroy Earth anymore?


01:14:30.823 --> 01:14:32.234
I can't do that.


01:14:32.234 --> 01:14:36.076
I never go back on my decisions.


01:14:36.076 --> 01:14:38.639
Then, what?


01:14:38.639 --> 01:14:42.392
It's about Uisu, the guy
who looks after me.


01:14:48.685 --> 01:14:53.270
He looks after me, but
he is also my teacher.


01:14:53.270 --> 01:14:55.030
Teacher?


01:14:55.030 --> 01:14:57.767
Then the universe's strongest...


01:14:58.720 --> 01:15:01.933
This is the 7th Universe.


01:15:01.933 --> 01:15:05.382
I am the 7th God of Destruction.


01:15:05.382 --> 01:15:09.332
There are 12 Universes in total.


01:15:09.332 --> 01:15:12.522
Don't you think there would be,
many more powerful beings?


01:15:33.079 --> 01:15:34.112
Goku!


01:15:34.112 --> 01:15:35.547
Goku!!


01:15:37.311 --> 01:15:40.826
I'm okay, I'm still alive.


01:15:40.826 --> 01:15:45.281
Then as promised,
I'll destroy Earth.


01:16:13.641 --> 01:16:19.337
Lord Birus, you've destroyed
a very small Earth.


01:16:19.337 --> 01:16:23.868
Unfortunately, I've used up
most of my stamina.


01:16:23.868 --> 01:16:27.672
I'll bring about complete destruction
next time.


01:16:27.672 --> 01:16:29.419
Lord Birus!


01:16:30.481 --> 01:16:35.240
You, when Lord Birus faces death, wouldn't you
like to become the next God of Destruction?


01:16:35.240 --> 01:16:36.717
Oi!


01:16:36.717 --> 01:16:38.461
I'll have to reject that.


01:16:38.461 --> 01:16:40.148
That's unfortunate.


01:16:40.148 --> 01:16:41.609
Madame Bulma,


01:16:41.609 --> 01:16:43.629
Me?


01:16:43.629 --> 01:16:45.317
What is it?


01:16:45.317 --> 01:16:48.008
Sorry for causing trouble.


01:16:48.429 --> 01:16:51.545
Other than that, apologise for hitting me!


01:16:52.702 --> 01:16:53.880
I'm sorry.


01:16:53.880 --> 01:16:55.870
Oi, are you stupid?


01:16:55.870 --> 01:16:58.704
If it's okay, invite me to another party.


01:16:58.704 --> 01:17:01.755
Only if you promise not to run wild.


01:17:01.755 --> 01:17:06.337
I understand, next time I will
definitely try that thing called pudding.


01:17:06.337 --> 01:17:08.929
I'll put tons in the pool!


01:17:08.929 --> 01:17:12.419
But don't say it tastes awful
after eating it!


01:17:12.419 --> 01:17:16.068
If it's awful, I'll destroy Earth.


01:17:16.068 --> 01:17:20.344
In that case, we'll be able to fight again,
right Lord Birus?


01:17:20.344 --> 01:17:22.026
This is goodbye.


01:17:37.900 --> 01:17:39.634
I can't believe it.


01:17:39.634 --> 01:17:41.261
It's without a doubt.


01:17:44.730 --> 01:17:49.342
The God of Destruction, Lord Birus,
didn't destroy!


01:17:49.342 --> 01:17:54.577
As expected, was it because of
Son Goku's mysterious character?


01:17:55.088 --> 01:17:57.796
He's gaining more comrades.


01:17:57.796 --> 01:18:00.509
Even Lord Birus...


01:18:01.537 --> 01:18:06.961
Put other things aside,
I can't see the extent to his potential.


01:18:06.961 --> 01:18:10.934
Though, it was nothing to worry about.


01:18:12.196 --> 01:18:19.579
Even so, it's been a while since
I've seen you use 70% of your powers, Lord Birus.


01:18:20.003 --> 01:18:21.837
What was he called again?


01:18:21.837 --> 01:18:24.218
Son Goku.


01:18:24.492 --> 01:18:30.343
Perhaps in the distant future,
he and Vegeta might become a real
enemy of threat.


01:18:30.343 --> 01:18:39.037
Come to think about it, I brought
these Sushi because they were so delicious!


01:18:39.037 --> 01:18:42.251
What a pleasant looking food~


01:18:42.251 --> 01:18:47.358
You eat it with small amounts of this
thing called soy sauce.


01:18:47.358 --> 01:18:50.014
What's this pile of green stuff?


01:18:52.405 --> 01:18:54.221
Come to think about it, the chef said,


01:18:54.221 --> 01:18:59.739
"Eat it depending on your preference."
I think it was called wasabi.


01:18:59.739 --> 01:19:03.163
Come to think about it,
I heard something like that?


01:19:03.163 --> 01:19:06.198
While I was fighting...


01:19:06.198 --> 01:19:08.332
I'll bring something to drink.


01:19:09.680 --> 01:19:11.009
Let's give it a taste.


01:19:25.056 --> 01:19:26.100
You can't do that!


01:19:29.998 --> 01:19:33.417
Please sleep for about three years.


01:19:34.274 --> 01:19:37.616
Lord Birus, you have to brush your teeth
before going to sleep!


01:19:39.395 --> 01:19:41.975
Okay, fine.


01:19:44.525 --> 01:19:46.605
One more time!


01:19:46.605 --> 01:19:50.437
Happy Birthday, Bulma!


01:19:50.437 --> 01:19:51.852
38 years old!


01:19:51.852 --> 01:19:53.005
Shut up!


01:20:06.519 --> 01:20:10.866
When cornered, you just might be
the most fearsome being.


01:20:10.866 --> 01:20:12.388
Oi, Kakarot.


01:20:12.388 --> 01:20:16.951
Next time, I'm becoming God,
so cooperate!


01:20:16.951 --> 01:20:18.817
Of course!


01:20:18.817 --> 01:20:22.754
But if you push yourself to become
that strong, you'll collapse later!


01:20:23.574 --> 01:20:25.262
Oh yeah, Vegeta.


01:20:25.262 --> 01:20:32.170
When Bulma got hit, you shouted; "My Bulma!"
and became a great Super Saiyan!


01:20:32.170 --> 01:20:34.309
I felt loved~


01:20:34.309 --> 01:20:37.852
I don't remember saying such thing!


01:20:37.852 --> 01:20:42.451
But, back then I definitely exceeded you!


01:20:42.451 --> 01:20:44.749
Yeah, without a doubt!


01:20:44.749 --> 01:20:47.158
Next time when we're fighting someone strong,


01:20:47.158 --> 01:20:50.213
I'll ask them to hit Bulma!


01:20:50.213 --> 01:20:51.215
Oi!


01:20:52.849 --> 01:20:57.864
When Vegeta was like that,
you shouldn't have been there.


01:20:57.864 --> 01:21:02.457
So you used instant transmission,
and watched from a distance.


01:21:05.769 --> 01:21:06.534
Son ?


01:21:06.534 --> 01:21:08.378
Are you serious, bastard!


01:21:08.378 --> 01:21:10.509
While everyone was being handed in!


01:21:10.509 --> 01:21:16.053
Sorry, I wanted to strategize
before fighting the enemy!


01:21:16.053 --> 01:21:18.947
Although I didn't remember anything.


01:21:18.947 --> 01:21:22.031
Bulma, slap him two, no three more times!


01:21:22.031 --> 01:21:22.952
Yes sir!


01:21:22.952 --> 01:21:27.032
I'm sorry! I regret it!


